;;; EXERCISE

#|
Make a short sketch for a high and a low instrument:

1. Create pitches:
first voice with high-pass filtered noise
second voice with low-pass filtered noise

2. Use the function [vector-to-pitch] to convert the
numbers to pitches.
See documentation of [gen-noise] how to do it.

3. Use the function [vector-to-length] to convert
the same numbers to lengths.
See documentation of [gen-noise] how to do it.

4. Make 2 voices from it with [make-omn] with any dynamic
and preview the score (See Score chapter for it.)
|#

;;; ---------------------------------------------------------